---
title: "Gas Tungsten Arc Welding (GTAW), Tungsten Inert Gas (TIG)"
code: "WEL-164"
category: "welding"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Introduces practical operations in the use of tungsten arc welding and equipment. Studies equipment operation setup, safety, and practice of Gas Tungsten Arc Welding (GTAW), Tungsten Inert Gas (TIG). Lecture 2 hours. Laboratory 3 hours. Additional course fee applies.
